{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21463172",
      "title": "Exploring Event Modifiers",
      "lectureOrder": 27,
      "videoOrder": 23,
      "sourceHash": "e363a92e885120ddff44327866bee4bf17c222105359a2da7426c47a36b215f8",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "Now that we got the basics about events down,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 7.16,
          "en": "let's talk about event modifiers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.16,
          "end": 10.023,
          "en": "which is another useful feature built into Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.96,
          "end": 13.03,
          "en": "Here's an example for an event modifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.03,
          "end": 15.28,
          "en": "that can sometimes be useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.28,
          "end": 18.78,
          "en": "Let's say you had a form HTML element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.78,
          "end": 23.78,
          "en": "in there you had some input and you had a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.55,
          "end": 27.78,
          "en": "that says, sign up, whatever,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.78,
          "end": 29.41,
          "en": "if you reload, you have that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.41,
          "end": 31.65,
          "en": "Now the problem you'll have by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 33.27,
          "en": "if you leave it like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.27,
          "end": 36.41,
          "en": "even if it's in the Vue controlled HTML part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.41,
          "end": 39.853,
          "en": "is that when you click this button, this page will reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.1,
          "end": 44.65,
          "en": "And the reason for that is that the browser default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.65,
          "end": 48.63,
          "en": "for a form with a button like this is to submit that form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.63,
          "end": 53.63,
          "en": "and send an HTTP request to the server serving this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.75,
          "end": 55.72,
          "en": "In this case we have no such server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.72,
          "end": 57.11,
          "en": "we're running this locally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.11,
          "end": 59.8,
          "en": "but still the browser simply sends a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.8,
          "end": 62.73,
          "en": "to our local machine therefore, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.73,
          "end": 65.53,
          "en": "Now, of course, we have no code in place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.53,
          "end": 67.71,
          "en": "to handle this request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.71,
          "end": 71.15,
          "en": "Now we'll get there later in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.15,
          "end": 74.28999999999999,
          "en": "but typically with frameworks like Vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.28999999999999,
          "end": 77.51,
          "en": "you wanna prevent this browser default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.51,
          "end": 81.62,
          "en": "and instead you wanna handle this manually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.62,
          "end": 85.62,
          "en": "in JavaScript with help of Vue in your Vue app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.62,
          "end": 89.28,
          "en": "and you wanna read the user input there, validate it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.28,
          "end": 92.12,
          "en": "and then send it manually to a backend server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.12,
          "end": 94.44,
          "en": "and store it in a database, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.44,
          "end": 97.00999999999999,
          "en": "So you wanna prevent that browser default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.00999999999999,
          "end": 98.893,
          "en": "of automatically sending it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.1,
          "end": 102.12,
          "en": "Now, there are two ways of doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.12,
          "end": 105.62,
          "en": "One of them is cool and the other one is well more obvious,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.62,
          "end": 106.81,
          "en": "I would say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.81,
          "end": 109.69,
          "en": "You can listen to the submit event here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.69,
          "end": 112.25,
          "en": "which again is a default browser event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.25,
          "end": 115.63,
          "en": "to which you can listen on form elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.63,
          "end": 117.38,
          "en": "Then we could have a method here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.38,
          "end": 120.27,
          "en": "submit form like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.27,
          "end": 123.9,
          "en": "at which we can point here, submit form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.9,
          "end": 126.87,
          "en": "Now we're telling Vue that whenever the form is submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.87,
          "end": 129.51,
          "en": "submit form should be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 129.51,
          "end": 131.27,
          "en": "And here we could do whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.27,
          "end": 133.763,
          "en": "For example, showing alert submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.8,
          "end": 137.64,
          "en": "Now right now, the problem is that we still have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 137.64,
          "end": 138.473,
          "en": "the browser default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.473,
          "end": 140.69,
          "en": "If I click this, I get the alert,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.69,
          "end": 144.13,
          "en": "but the page reloads thereafter, and when the page reloads,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.13,
          "end": 146.8,
          "en": "that means we lose all our data, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.8,
          "end": 150.32,
          "en": "If I had a counter here and I click sign up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.32,
          "end": 152.07,
          "en": "you'll see that all the data is lost",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.07,
          "end": 155.63,
          "en": "because of the page reload, the Vue app restarts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 155.63,
          "end": 156.63,
          "en": "so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.63,
          "end": 159.44,
          "en": "So we haven't solved the problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.44,
          "end": 163.32999999999998,
          "en": "but remember that we get this default event object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.32999999999998,
          "end": 166.06,
          "en": "I talked about that in the last lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 166.06,
          "end": 169.32,
          "en": "Now we can call prevent default on that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 169.32,
          "end": 172.19,
          "en": "This is a default browser mechanism,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 172.19,
          "end": 173.88,
          "en": "it's built in JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.88,
          "end": 176.81,
          "en": "which is totally independent from Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 176.81,
          "end": 180.13,
          "en": "Even if we just used Vanilla JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 180.13,
          "end": 182.64,
          "en": "on that default event object, which we get,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 182.64,
          "end": 184.663,
          "en": "we could call prevent default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.545,
          "end": 187.21,
          "en": "And this would tell the browser that the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 187.21,
          "end": 188.89,
          "en": "should not be submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 188.89,
          "end": 191.383,
          "en": "that we don't want that browser default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192.22,
          "end": 195.34,
          "en": "So now if I reload, I can change my counter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 195.34,
          "end": 198.99,
          "en": "click sign up, we see the alert and the counter still",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 198.99,
          "end": 201.74,
          "en": "is there because now that browser default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 201.74,
          "end": 203.073,
          "en": "has been prevented.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 204.19,
          "end": 207.32999999999998,
          "en": "This works and there's nothing wrong with it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 207.32999999999998,
          "end": 210.92000000000002,
          "en": "but Vue has a nicer way for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 210.92000000000002,
          "end": 212.69,
          "en": "We can remove all that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 212.69,
          "end": 217.01,
          "en": "and instead use a so-called event modifier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 217.01,
          "end": 220.16,
          "en": "There are certain built in modifiers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 220.16,
          "end": 224.633,
          "en": "which you can connect to events you're listening to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 224.633,
          "end": 226.74,
          "en": "let's say to change that event behavior,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 226.74,
          "end": 231.74,
          "en": "and you add such a modifier with a dot after the event name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 232.16,
          "end": 233.81,
          "en": "after v-on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 233.81,
          "end": 237.71,
          "en": "So v-on: then the event name and then a dot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 237.71,
          "end": 239.91,
          "en": "if you want the modifier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 239.91,
          "end": 243.11,
          "en": "Now, there are only a couple of supported modifiers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 243.11,
          "end": 245.84,
          "en": "You can find a full list in the official docs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 245.84,
          "end": 250.35,
          "en": "For example, there is a prevent modifier and this modifier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 250.35,
          "end": 254.68,
          "en": "which is built into Vue will prevent the browser default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 254.68,
          "end": 259.21,
          "en": "So it will basically do what we did manually a second ago",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 259.21,
          "end": 260.943,
          "en": "just with less code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 261.82,
          "end": 265.83,
          "en": "There always is a stop modifier for stopping propagation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 265.83,
          "end": 268.85,
          "en": "but here we need to prevent modifier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 268.85,
          "end": 272.49,
          "en": "And with data, if you reload, I can sign up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 272.49,
          "end": 275.6,
          "en": "We see that alert and still the page doesn't reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 275.6,
          "end": 278.24,
          "en": "thanks to this modifier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 278.24,
          "end": 282.44,
          "en": "So that's nice to know, and that will come in handy later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 282.44,
          "end": 284.77,
          "en": "We don't just have such event modifiers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 284.77,
          "end": 287.59000000000003,
          "en": "to change the event and browser behavior,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 287.59000000000003,
          "end": 291.34000000000003,
          "en": "we also have modifiers we can connect to events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 291.34000000000003,
          "end": 294.46,
          "en": "to change when the event occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 294.46,
          "end": 296.79,
          "en": "And one example would be our buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 296.79,
          "end": 299.44,
          "en": "Let's say for whatever reason,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 299.44,
          "end": 303.48,
          "en": "we only wanna subtract five if the user right clicks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 303.48,
          "end": 304.8,
          "en": "on the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 304.8,
          "end": 308.67,
          "en": "The default of course is to react to a left click.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 308.67,
          "end": 310.75,
          "en": "But if you want it to react to a right click,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 310.75,
          "end": 313.48,
          "en": "we could add a modifier here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 313.48,
          "end": 315.513,
          "en": "And we can set it to right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 316.4,
          "end": 320.11,
          "en": "Alternative values are left, which you don't need to specify",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 320.11,
          "end": 324.47,
          "en": "because it's the default, middle and well, right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 324.47,
          "end": 326.83,
          "en": "And this tells Vue that here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 326.83,
          "end": 330.22,
          "en": "you only wanna react to a right click.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 330.22,
          "end": 332.7,
          "en": "So when you're using a mouse event like click,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 332.7,
          "end": 336.23,
          "en": "you can use the right, left and middle event modifiers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 336.23,
          "end": 340.223,
          "en": "to change which mouse button triggers this event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 341.21,
          "end": 342.71,
          "en": "So if we now save this, you see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 342.71,
          "end": 345.65999999999997,
          "en": "I can add 10 by clicking with the left key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 345.65999999999997,
          "end": 347.52,
          "en": "but if I click on subtract five",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 347.52,
          "end": 349.74,
          "en": "with the left key, nothing happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 349.74,
          "end": 352.15,
          "en": "If I use the right mouse button, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 352.15,
          "end": 353.8,
          "en": "which you can tell I'm doing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 353.8,
          "end": 356.1,
          "en": "because my context menu opens up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 356.1,
          "end": 358.61,
          "en": "now the counter gets smaller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 358.61,
          "end": 361.92,
          "en": "Of course we can argue whether that's useful here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 361.92,
          "end": 366.22,
          "en": "but it's definitely useful to be aware of those modifiers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 366.22,
          "end": 368.86,
          "en": "And there's a last kind of modifiers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 368.86,
          "end": 371,
          "en": "And that would be key modifiers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 371,
          "end": 373.61,
          "en": "when you're listening to keyboard events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 373.61,
          "end": 375.89,
          "en": "like here on the input element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 375.89,
          "end": 379.44,
          "en": "Currently we're updating the name upon the input event here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 379.44,
          "end": 381.37,
          "en": "so on every keystroke.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 381.37,
          "end": 386.18,
          "en": "Now let's say we wanna update the internally stored name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 386.18,
          "end": 389.95,
          "en": "sold as name property with every keystroke,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 389.95,
          "end": 394.48,
          "en": "but the name that's being output here should only be updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 394.48,
          "end": 399.48,
          "en": "when the user hits enter on this input element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
